<statement>
<tabular>   

<row><cell>Which of the following does NOT reveal the variation (spread) of the data?  <em>Check all that apply.</em></cell></row>

<row><cell><p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>Standard Deviation</li> 
<li>Mode</li> 
<li>Mean</li> 
<li>Median</li> 
<li>Range</li> 
</ol></p>
</cell></row>

</tabular>
</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li><p>Mean</p>
<p>Mode</p>
<p>Median</p></li></ul></p>
</answer>

